@startuml sequence-maintenance
actor U as "Utilisateur"
participant FE as "Frontend"
participant GW as "API Gateway"
participant MS as "maintenance-service"
participant AS as "asset-service"

== Création de la demande ==
U->>FE: POST /maintenance/nouvelle
FE->>FE: POST /api/auth/login (session JWT)
FE->>GW: POST /api/maintenance/requests {asset_id, description, priority}
GW->>MS: /api/requests (Bearer JWT)
MS->>AS: GET /api/assets/{id} (token propagé)
AS-->>MS: bien {code, designation, status}
MS->>MS: INSERT maintenance_request (snapshot bien)
MS-->>FE: 201 {reference MNT-AAAA-NNNN}

== Démarrage des travaux ==
U->>FE: « Démarrer »
FE->>GW: POST /api/maintenance/requests/{id}/start
GW->>MS: /api/requests/{id}/start
MS->>MS: statut → in_progress, memorise statut precedent du bien
MS->>AS: POST /api/assets/{id}/status {in_maintenance}
AS->>AS: transition + asset_status_histories
AS-->>MS: 200
MS-->>FE: 200
Note over MS,AS: Si asset-service indisponible → 503 + rollback local

== Intervention ==
U->>FE: « Ajouter une intervention »
FE->>GW: POST /api/maintenance/requests/{id}/interventions
GW->>MS: /api/requests/{id}/interventions
MS->>MS: INSERT intervention (technicien, cout, date)
MS-->>FE: 201

== Clôture ==
U->>FE: « Terminer »
FE->>GW: POST /api/maintenance/requests/{id}/complete
GW->>MS: /api/requests/{id}/complete
MS->>AS: POST /api/assets/{id}/status {statut precedent}
AS-->>MS: 200
MS->>MS: statut → completed
MS-->>FE: 200

@enduml
